# Copy this file to .env and fill in what you have. Commands tell you when one is needed.
# .env is gitignored. Never commit it, never paste a key into a chat or a page.

# ── Research + data ──
# Apify - /context-layer's social sweep, /gbp-posts' Reddit scrape.
# Free tier works. apify.com
APIFY_TOKEN=
# Pexels - stock photos, only with the owner's OK.
# Free, no card: pexels.com/api. Falls back to Openverse without it.
PEXELS_API_KEY=
# Google Search Console service account - /gsc walks you through creating it.
GSC_KEY_FILE=gsc-key.json

# ── Leads ──
# None needed. The contact, quote and 1-3 star review forms post to Oscar's
# lead relay (eosmelbourne.com/api/lead) with the site's `leadSite` id from
# website/lib/site.config.ts. The relay's own table picks the inbox.
